"firstrun.whenItBreaks.body" = "Text didn't paste? It isn't lost. The badge expands and shows it, and you can copy it from there.";
"firstrun.whenItBreaks.note" = "Did I hear a word wrong? Fix it in the dictionary and I'll write it right from then on.\n\nThis window, settings and history open from the menu bar icon.";
