"settings.avtoBeretYazykSistemy" = "«Auto» follows the system. Your own choice wins over it: macOS can be in English while you want the interface in Russian.\n\nA new language takes effect after you restart the app: the texts are built once, at launch.";
"settings.srokSchitaetsyaPoDate" = "The age is counted by the folder's date. Anything older goes at the next launch, quietly and without the Trash. «Always» turns the cleanup off completely.\n\nJunk is removed regardless of the age: an unpacked model archive that has its folder right next to it, and a quarantine older than a month. There is nothing to lose there — those are copies of what you already have.";
